{"id":"veshch_","lemma":"вещь","pos":"noun","rank":219,"glosses":["thing, object","things, belongings, goods, stuff"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/50/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%89%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%89%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"вещи","plural":"вещи"},"examples":[{"text":"Зачем вам эти вещи?","en":"Why do you need these things?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1270110","words":[{"g":"why, what for"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},{"g":"this/that one","l":"этот"},null]},{"text":"Могу я сказать одну вещь?","en":"Can I say one thing?","words":[{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to say, to tell"},null,null]},{"text":"Он делал такие вещи?","en":"Did he do such things?","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"},null,null]},{"text":"Это, наверное, хорошая вещь.","en":"That's probably a good thing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/787190","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"probably, most likely"},{"g":"good, nice, fine","l":"хороший"},null]},{"text":"Вот мои вещи.","en":"Here are my things.","words":[{"g":"here is"},{"g":"my","l":"мой"},null]}]}